* `buildC v l`: push on stack `20` the (reversed) pointwise sum mod 2 of the streams `l`.
* `rebuildC W v T`: replace the table by the streams `w ↦ Σ_{w' ∈ T w} F w'` (`rebuildC_sp`).

Scratch stacks: `15` (park), `16` (copy), `17` (temp), `19` (zip out), `20` (new table),
`21` (loop counter).
